  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Election Management Capacity Building Program : Elections and Media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x25A0; Project Objective 
  - Promote election management bodies&#x2019; capabilities of responding to misinformation and fake news by sharing experience, knowledge, and know-how
  - Contribute to developing media-related regulations and election management by sharing the media monitoring cases in South Korea. 
&#x25A0; Project Overview
  - Support vulnerable institutions struggling with regulations or monitoring capacity in responding to the spread of fake news and misinformation by advancing their system by comparing and analyzing the relevant regulations in South Korea and other countries.</narrative>
  </description>
